    "description": "Farm (farmhouse), level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. The farmer's house: a big two-storey farmhouse, a cobblestone ground floor with stone brick quoins under a dark oak timber frame jettied over the front, spruce roof with dark eaves, brick chimney, a stair inside; flower boxes, lanterns, composter, hay and barrel at the door from L1. L2 adds a lean-to woodshed, gable trim, potted flowers and a bench; L3 a 15-tall tower windmill with lattice sails and beehives. The fields are separate modules (farm_field_*). Not yet builder-tested: beehive, dandelion, sunflower, white_wool. Decoration step adds: item_frame, potted_plant.",
    "changes": "The house is now a big two-storey farmhouse from L1 (stone ground floor, jettied timber upper floor, stairs inside, flower boxes and farm props at the door); L2 adds a woodshed, L3 the windmill with lattice sails (fence frame and wool panels) and beehives, so each level adds something visible.",
    "parent": 2,
